+/// An altered quotation's marks: a bracketed letter or word run into the words it alters
+/// ("[t]he", "assess[ed]"), "[sic]", a bracketed ellipsis, or a note of the alteration. A form's
+/// bracketed blank ("[name of interpreter]") stands apart from its words.
+fn alteration_re() -> &'static Regex {
